      "source": "For non-realtime decompression, clients may set this property to [`kCFBooleanFalse`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/kCFBooleanFalse), which indicates that it is OK to run this decode pipeline at a lower priority than is used for realtime decoding.",
